      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"generated-counterterms\">Generated counterterms</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Expand the bare factors <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_\\phi||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_\\phi Z_m||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_g Z_\\phi^{3/2}||)</marimo-tex>. The generated local vertices supply the three-by-three matching system; no renormalization constants are provided as inputs.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">MS subtracts <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1/\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>. MS\u0304 subtracts <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Delta=1/\\epsilon+\\log(4\\pi)-\\gamma_E||)</marimo-tex>. The exact checks retain the finite difference between schemes.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
